Send a surge of power into all turrets in sight, extending their duration by [2, 2, 3, 3, 4 (TL1-5)] turns and granting them a charged shield absorbing [379, 510, 612, 698, 774 (TL1-5; STEAMPOWER 100)] damage for 10 turns. While the shield holds, each turn the turret will project a bolt of lightning dealing [59, 79, 95, 108, 120 (TL1-5; STEAMPOWER 100)] lightning damage to a random enemy in radius 6, with a 25% chance to daze.

The effects will increase with your Steampower.
